# 2026-07-06 OAuth popup blocked

## What I was trying to do
Here I was trying to set up my credentials, so that n8n can add data to my google sheets. 
## What broke
When I clicked "Sign in with Google," it would say the account was not connected, even with a popup that said "credential saved." 
## What I thought was wrong
At first, I thought that the credentials was wrong or broken.
## What was actually wrong
Brave was silently blocking the Google sign in popup.
## How I found it
The browser tab above said "Pop-up Window Blocked." Once I saw this I allowed popups for the n8n site, and then the sign in worked.
## Takeaway
When an OAuth "connect" fails or does not go through, check if the browser killed the popup before assuming the credential is wrong.
